  "description": "Dremel's line of Max Life high-performance accessories provide long-lasting performance and impressive durability. Built to give you longer lasting, stronger performing, versatile accessories. The Max Life 9901HP Tungsten Carbide Carving Bit is coated in titanium nitride and is engineered to last 2X longer than the standard, non-coated Dremel 9901 bit. For use with all Dremel high-speed rotary tools, the 1/8 In. (3.2 mm) accessory can be used for more aggressive applications to shape, smooth, or grind hard materials such as metals, hardened steel, fire ceramics, cast iron, plastics, and hardwoods. The carving bit works well for projects like metal or glass engraving, stone carving, or removing flash from castings. The cylinder shape of the carving bit allows for deep removal of material, cuts flat areas, round edges and makes stop cuts and V-cuts. The accessory tip makes flat bottom slots and grooves, flat side cuts, and makes V-cuts when held at 45-degrees. 1 rotary accessory included.",
